N5008 [temp.deduct.call]/2-3: for P = T & the argument type is the
function type, without the function-to-pointer conversion, so
T = void(int).  The front end deduced from the decayed pointer and found
no match for call_deduced (bin53).  g++ 13 and clang++ 18 accept this
program (-std=c++98), and it fails only its WRONG assertion.
